## Skill 2: Animation System (Framer Motion)

### QUAN TRỌNG
- **LUÔN** dùng `variants` pattern — KHÔNG dùng inline `animate` props
- **LUÔN** import variants từ `@/styles/animations`
- **LUÔN** wrap animated sections trong `motion.div`
- Dùng `useInView` hook cho scroll-triggered animations

### Predefined Variants (sử dụng từ `@/styles/animations.ts`)
```typescript
import { fadeInUp, staggerContainer, pageTransition, hoverLift } from '@/styles/animations'

// Page wrapper
<motion.div variants={pageTransition} initial="initial" animate="animate" exit="exit">

// Staggered list
<motion.div variants={staggerContainer} initial="hidden" animate="visible">
  {items.map(item => (
    <motion.div key={item.id} variants={fadeInUp}>
      <Card data={item} />
    </motion.div>
  ))}
</motion.div>

// Hover interaction
<motion.div variants={hoverLift} whileHover="hover" whileTap="tap">
```

### Animation Rules
- Page transitions: 0.6s duration, ease-out
- Stagger delay: 0.08s between children
- Hover transitions: 0.2s duration
- Scroll trigger: trigger at 20% visibility (`amount: 0.2`)
- Parallax: max 30px movement, `useScroll` + `useTransform`
- **KHÔNG** animate layout properties (width, height) — chỉ transform + opacity

