### Responsive Breakpoints (Mobile-first)
```
Default:  < 640px  (mobile)
sm:       ≥ 640px  (large phone / small tablet)
md:       ≥ 768px  (tablet)
lg:       ≥ 1024px (desktop)
xl:       ≥ 1280px (large desktop)
2xl:      ≥ 1536px (ultra-wide)
```

