## Skill 4: Page Architecture

### Public Page Template
Mỗi public page PHẢI có:
```typescript
export function ExamplePage() {
  return (
    <>
      <SEOHead 
        title="Page Title — Carpets Inter Vietnam"
        description="Meta description for SEO"
        ogImage="/images/brand/og-default.jpg"
      />
      
      {/* Hero Section — above the fold, impactful */}
      <HeroSection />
      
      {/* Content Sections — each with scroll animation */}
      <motion.section variants={staggerContainer} initial="hidden" whileInView="visible">
        {/* ... */}
      </motion.section>
      
      {/* CTA Section — call to action before footer */}
      <CTASection />
    </>
  )
}
```

